  "details": "If the avatar root scale is not 1.00, avatar become unexpected size.\n\nProbably the avatar scale is forced to change to 1.00.\n\nIn the screenshot case, for example, root scale is 0.19 in Unity, but in OpenBeta VRChat, it became  too large. It probably became 5.26 multiplied size of current size.  (1.00 / 0.19 = 5.26...)",
